            "body": " @superatomic I can disable it globally, but I think the repo maintainer can turn it off per repo.  I've seen this in other repos \r\n<img width=\"737\" height=\"229\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/181ac79b-c9df-4bcd-a51b-e8c66b3f7012\" />\r\n\r\nHere's the setting in one of my repos: \r\n<img width=\"757\" height=\"201\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/406fd4f6-9879-4b48-bc12-0902ffa4ef69\" />\r\n\r\n",
