        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "cc @justinmk I assume you have repo editing permissions.\r\n\r\ntl;dr: two contributors (@superatomic and clason) have complained about automatic Copilot reviews on PRs.  I can only turn it off globally, but you have a setting to disable it in this repo.  See my last comment.\r\n\r\n(imo I don't see the problem with it, since it can often highlight a low-hanging fruit, and if not closing the review is simple, but I understand wanting to keep code reviews slop-free, so it's up to you :) )",
