        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Please don't request LLM review on PRs; you can do that on your own fork.\r\n\r\n> I think the maintainer can disable Copilot reviews\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, this is not true. (Baffling, I know.) The repo-wide setting can request it by default on _all_ PRs, but it cannot prevent users from requesting it on _their_ PRs.\r\n\r\nYou need to disable this in your own settings and then open a new PR.",
